Before you stands the master of the keep, Behern the warlock. And while
Behern is weak compared to sorcerers such as Krogthar and his minions,
or the vile Jher, he is no pushover either.
Behern is a handsome young man with long white hair, and deep blue eyes.
He would appear to be almost angelic were it not for the diabolical gleam
to his eyes, and the evil grin on his thin, cruel lips.
~
